{"id":"c238813071f77433","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-function-composition.md","title":"函数复合","display":"df-function-composition — 函数复合","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-function-composition","aliases":["18-df-function-composition","18-df-004"],"display":"df-function-composition — 函数复合","depends_on":["[[18-df-primitive-recursive-terms]]"],"source_title":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity","source_edition":"Springer, 2009; ISBN 978-3-540-69318-5","source_section":"2.1.2–2.1.4","source_printed_pages":"10–11","source_pdf_pages":"21–22","source_correspondence":"source-adapted","source_statement_status":"checked-2026-10-13"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-function-composition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-function-composition</span><span>18-df-004</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-function-composition — 函数复合"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f04544345afa1f92\" href=\"?note=f04544345afa1f92\" title=\"18-df-primitive-recursive-terms\">18-df-primitive-recursive-terms</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_title","html":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Springer, 2009; ISBN 978-3-540-69318-5"},{"key":"source_section","html":"2.1.2–2.1.4"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"10–11"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"21–22"},{"key":"source_correspondence","html":"source-adapted"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-2026-10-13"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\ge1\">\\(m\\ge1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:\\mathbb N^m\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(h:\\mathbb N^m\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g_1,\\ldots,g_m:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(g_1,\\ldots,g_m:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Comp}\">\\(\\operatorname{Comp}\\)</span> 是外延函数复合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}\\)</span> 的函数项接口见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f04544345afa1f92\" href=\"?note=f04544345afa1f92\" title=\"18-df-primitive-recursive-terms\">18-df-primitive-recursive-terms</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Comp}(h,g_1,\\ldots,g_m)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\vec x,z\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^k\\times\\mathbb N:\nz=h(g_1(\\vec x),\\ldots,g_m(\\vec x))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Comp}(h,g_1,\\ldots,g_m)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\vec x,z\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^k\\times\\mathbb N:\nz=h(g_1(\\vec x),\\ldots,g_m(\\vec x))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Comp}(h,g_1,\\ldots,g_m):\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Comp}(h,g_1,\\ldots,g_m):\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书称函数项构造为 Sub；本节点保留原笔记 Comp 作为其外延对应，外函数在前。函数图对每个输入有唯一输出。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-primitive-recursive-terms","status":"resolved","id":"f04544345afa1f92","ancho